[
  {
    "claim_id": "EP003/C01",
    "normalized_statement": "博主报告本次加息25BP且一致通过；这是作者报告，未独立核实。",
    "quotes": [
      {
        "cue_id": 1,
        "time_range": "00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:20,150",
        "quote": "大家好，今天跟大家聊聊美联储的一期会议啊，昨天晚上两点钟啊，美联储如约，加息25个BP这次的这个加息呢呃跟之前呢有很多的不一样。第一个不一样的是全票通过啊，没有任何一个票尾。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 2,
        "time_range": "00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:40,150",
        "quote": "再觉得加息是一个不能接受的事儿了。现在唯一的争议呢就变成了是加一次加两次还是加多次。目前呢市场上对于卧室讲话的反馈啊是认为呢那可能这次加息还不足够。但是如果是这样的一个剧情的话是吧这次加息不足够，12月份还要继续加的话，。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 3,
        "time_range": "00:00:40,150 --> 00:01:00,000",
        "quote": "那压力就显然是传导到了日本这边。在上个星期啊，星期四的时候，我跟大家分析过是吧？啊，星期五的时候跟大家分析过，对于日本来说的话，目前的这个市场的调节走势实际上是通过日元升值给日元。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 4,
        "time_range": "00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,990",
        "quote": "营造出来了一定的。"
      }
    ],
    "initial_disposition": "active",
    "numeric_policy": "All literal numbers, units, modal and negation tokens remain in unmodified quotes; no inferred conversion.",
    "assertion_time": "UNKNOWN",
    "referenced_time": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_EXPLICIT_IN_QUOTES",
    "external_truth": "NOT_VERIFIED"
  },
  {
    "claim_id": "EP003/C02",
    "normalized_statement": "博主主张用两国利差解释货币影响，不能只看一个国家的利率。",
    "quotes": [
      {
        "cue_id": 11,
        "time_range": "00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:22,820",
        "quote": "如果说呢美联储这边加25个BP。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 12,
        "time_range": "00:01:22,820 --> 00:01:27,140",
        "quote": "日本这边也同步加20股币，相当于互相之间的相对关系不变。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 13,
        "time_range": "00:01:27,190 --> 00:01:29,020",
        "quote": "这个局势还能维持下去。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 14,
        "time_range": "00:01:29,030 --> 00:01:30,090",
        "quote": "但是。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 15,
        "time_range": "00:01:30,430 --> 00:01:31,990",
        "quote": "日元享升值。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 16,
        "time_range": "00:01:31,990 --> 00:01:34,740",
        "quote": "就得打破这样的一个相对关系不变。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 17,
        "time_range": "00:01:34,740 --> 00:01:35,720",
        "quote": "也就是说呢。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 18,
        "time_range": "00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:39,100",
        "quote": "日本的央行加息要超过美元加息，实让中间。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 19,
        "time_range": "00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:41,760",
        "quote": "日美之间的利差啊缩小。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 20,
        "time_range": "00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:44,630",
        "quote": "这个日元才有一个强劲的升值支撑。"
      }
    ],
    "initial_disposition": "active",
    "numeric_policy": "All literal numbers, units, modal and negation tokens remain in unmodified quotes; no inferred conversion.",
    "assertion_time": "UNKNOWN",
    "referenced_time": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_EXPLICIT_IN_QUOTES",
    "external_truth": "NOT_VERIFIED"
  },
  {
    "claim_id": "EP003/C03",
    "normalized_statement": "博主认为市场类比已从一次性加息转向上一轮加息周期，叙事参照发生变化。",
    "quotes": [
      {
        "cue_id": 31,
        "time_range": "00:02:10,330 --> 00:02:15,430",
        "quote": "真正到学子落地的时候，就是加息这个决定下来了以后，市场马上就会转变。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 32,
        "time_range": "00:02:15,430 --> 00:02:19,010",
        "quote": "马上就变成讨论，这次加息是一次性的还是多次的？"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 33,
        "time_range": "00:02:19,010 --> 00:02:19,530",
        "quote": "系嘛。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 34,
        "time_range": "00:02:19,530 --> 00:02:21,610",
        "quote": "现在市场上讨论是不是已经变了，而且。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 35,
        "time_range": "00:02:21,610 --> 00:02:25,460",
        "quote": "已经有说辞出来了啊吧，这是一个长期的加息。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 36,
        "time_range": "00:02:25,490 --> 00:02:29,380",
        "quote": "甚至呢各方的报道都在强行的把这件事情。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 37,
        "time_range": "00:02:29,380 --> 00:02:30,850",
        "quote": "啊，往这个上面带。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 38,
        "time_range": "00:02:30,940 --> 00:02:32,100",
        "quote": "在。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 39,
        "time_range": "00:02:32,100 --> 00:02:33,970",
        "quote": "昨天晚上2点钟之前。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 40,
        "time_range": "00:02:33,970 --> 00:02:39,210",
        "quote": "大家普遍的拿的例子对比，这次加息可能性的例子是1997年那次。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 41,
        "time_range": "00:02:39,210 --> 00:02:40,080",
        "quote": "那说啥呢？"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 42,
        "time_range": "00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:43,820",
        "quote": "说1997年那次加了一次25个VP，持续了很长时间。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 43,
        "time_range": "00:02:43,820 --> 00:02:46,310",
        "quote": "有后面的好长好长时间都是。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 44,
        "time_range": "00:02:46,310 --> 00:02:48,010",
        "quote": "只加了一次就按兵不动了。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 45,
        "time_range": "00:02:48,010 --> 00:02:50,990",
        "quote": "然后一次告诉你了啊，这次的加息是一次性的。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 46,
        "time_range": "00:02:50,990 --> 00:02:56,110",
        "quote": "但是当昨天2点钟凌晨2点钟结束以后是吧，加息决定公布以后的话。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 47,
        "time_range": "00:02:56,110 --> 00:02:59,500",
        "quote": "市面上讨论的问题就不再提什么1997年了。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 48,
        "time_range": "00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:00,350",
        "quote": "而给你提。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 49,
        "time_range": "00:03:00,350 --> 00:03:03,260",
        "quote": "这是三年以来第一次的加息。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 50,
        "time_range": "00:03:03,260 --> 00:03:06,750",
        "quote": "2023年7月份啊，那是上一次的加息。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 51,
        "time_range": "00:03:06,750 --> 00:03:08,580",
        "quote": "到现在时隔三年了。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 52,
        "time_range": "00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:10,350",
        "quote": "那话里话派的意思是啥呢？"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 53,
        "time_range": "00:03:10,350 --> 00:03:10,980",
        "quote": "那。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 54,
        "time_range": "00:03:10,980 --> 00:03:11,620",
        "quote": "你看。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 55,
        "time_range": "00:03:11,620 --> 00:03:13,790",
        "quote": "前面的这个紧周期。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 56,
        "time_range": "00:03:13,790 --> 00:03:15,210",
        "quote": "然后有了宽周期。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 57,
        "time_range": "00:03:15,210 --> 00:03:16,860",
        "quote": "现在又到锦州去了。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 58,
        "time_range": "00:03:16,860 --> 00:03:22,600",
        "quote": "这是个周期性的变化。也就是说呢，这次加息不是一次性的，后边还会有紧接着好几次的。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 59,
        "time_range": "00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:24,060",
        "quote": "而目前呢。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 60,
        "time_range": "00:03:24,060 --> 00:03:26,580",
        "quote": "市场上透露出来的。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 61,
        "time_range": "00:03:26,580 --> 00:03:28,130",
        "quote": "安抚市场的意见。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 62,
        "time_range": "00:03:28,130 --> 00:03:30,160",
        "quote": "是今年还有第二次加息。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 63,
        "time_range": "00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:32,630",
        "quote": "这个已经变成了安抚市场的预见了。"
      }
    ],
    "initial_disposition": "active",
    "numeric_policy": "All literal numbers, units, modal and negation tokens remain in unmodified quotes; no inferred conversion.",
    "assertion_time": "UNKNOWN",
    "referenced_time": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_EXPLICIT_IN_QUOTES",
    "external_truth": "NOT_VERIFIED"
  },
  {
    "claim_id": "EP003/C04",
    "normalized_statement": "若日本给出的后续加息指引不足，博主担心日元继续承压。",
    "quotes": [
      {
        "cue_id": 67,
        "time_range": "00:03:38,610 --> 00:03:41,450",
        "quote": "9月18号就是明天啊这个。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 68,
        "time_range": "00:03:41,450 --> 00:03:44,230",
        "quote": "日元的这个加息决议出来了以后。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 69,
        "time_range": "00:03:44,230 --> 00:03:46,940",
        "quote": "如果不能够满足市场上。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 70,
        "time_range": "00:03:46,940 --> 00:03:50,190",
        "quote": "对于后续加息路径的清晰承诺的话。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 71,
        "time_range": "00:03:50,190 --> 00:03:52,290",
        "quote": "日元还有贬值的压力。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 72,
        "time_range": "00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:56,230",
        "quote": "这几天，日元已经从最高峰的152。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 73,
        "time_range": "00:03:56,230 --> 00:03:57,350",
        "quote": "比亿美元。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 74,
        "time_range": "00:03:57,350 --> 00:04:00,080",
        "quote": "跌到了155比1美元，那么。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 75,
        "time_range": "00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:01,630",
        "quote": "轻轻受中的。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 76,
        "time_range": "00:04:01,630 --> 00:04:03,060",
        "quote": "什么都没发生。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 77,
        "time_range": "00:04:03,410 --> 00:04:04,450",
        "quote": "The."
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 78,
        "time_range": "00:04:04,450 --> 00:04:06,080",
        "quote": "这日元已经跌了。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 79,
        "time_range": "00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,900",
        "quote": "啊，330元了。"
      }
    ],
    "initial_disposition": "active",
    "numeric_policy": "All literal numbers, units, modal and negation tokens remain in unmodified quotes; no inferred conversion.",
    "assertion_time": "UNKNOWN",
    "referenced_time": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_EXPLICIT_IN_QUOTES",
    "external_truth": "NOT_VERIFIED"
  },
  {
    "claim_id": "EP003/C05",
    "normalized_statement": "汇率点位、单位及变动幅度字幕需核对。",
    "quotes": [
      {
        "cue_id": 80,
        "time_range": "00:04:07,900 --> 00:04:10,290",
        "quote": "那后边的话，如果说他这个。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 81,
        "time_range": "00:04:10,290 --> 00:04:11,570",
        "quote": "加息的这个预期。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 82,
        "time_range": "00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:13,270",
        "quote": "不是特别的强烈。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 83,
        "time_range": "00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:16,220",
        "quote": "啊，加线路径不是清特别的清晰的话。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 84,
        "time_range": "00:04:16,220 --> 00:04:18,060",
        "quote": "那可以想见的。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 85,
        "time_range": "00:04:18,100 --> 00:04:20,590",
        "quote": "日本的央行出台了。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 86,
        "time_range": "00:04:20,590 --> 00:04:23,560",
        "quote": "就是9月18号出台了加息的决议。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 87,
        "time_range": "00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,700",
        "quote": "结果呢市场并不买单。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 88,
        "time_range": "00:04:25,700 --> 00:04:27,290",
        "quote": "继续的唱空日月。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 89,
        "time_range": "00:04:27,430 --> 00:04:30,210",
        "quote": "这个事情出来了以后才是真正的对。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 90,
        "time_range": "00:04:30,210 --> 00:04:33,200",
        "quote": "日本的金融秩序的一个极大的挑战。"
      }
    ],
    "initial_disposition": "deferred",
    "numeric_policy": "All literal numbers, units, modal and negation tokens remain in unmodified quotes; no inferred conversion.",
    "assertion_time": "UNKNOWN",
    "referenced_time": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_EXPLICIT_IN_QUOTES",
    "external_truth": "NOT_VERIFIED"
  },
  {
    "claim_id": "EP003/C06",
    "normalized_statement": "汇率干预金额和美日成本比较中数值、单位冲突，暂缓定量结论。",
    "quotes": [
      {
        "cue_id": 99,
        "time_range": "00:05:07,410 --> 00:05:09,370",
        "quote": "美国只出了10亿。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 100,
        "time_range": "00:05:09,370 --> 00:05:12,990",
        "quote": "日本出了980多亿是吧，美国只出了10亿。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 101,
        "time_range": "00:05:12,990 --> 00:05:14,300",
        "quote": "效果斐然。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 102,
        "time_range": "00:05:14,300 --> 00:05:15,770",
        "quote": "非常非常好的效果。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 103,
        "time_range": "00:05:15,770 --> 00:05:16,620",
        "quote": "然后呢。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 104,
        "time_range": "00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:21,550",
        "quote": "顺带呢给你啊自己洋洋得意的一法啊，彩彩虹壁纸自己吹自己。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 105,
        "time_range": "00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:24,140",
        "quote": "说虽然呢这不是我们有意为之的。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 106,
        "time_range": "00:05:24,140 --> 00:05:24,800",
        "quote": "但是。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 107,
        "time_range": "00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:29,550",
        "quote": "经过这个汇率狙击战呢，我们有了几千亿啊几千万美元的盈利。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 108,
        "time_range": "00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:32,680",
        "quote": "啥意思呢？话里话外告诉你，我占了便宜了。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 109,
        "time_range": "00:05:32,730 --> 00:05:36,160",
        "quote": "帮助日元控制它的汇率啊升值。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 110,
        "time_range": "00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:40,600",
        "quote": "对美国来说，起码从财政部的财政角度来说的话，我们是赚钱的。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 111,
        "time_range": "00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,380",
        "quote": "那行呗。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 112,
        "time_range": "00:05:41,380 --> 00:05:44,210",
        "quote": "那美国赚钱了，那谁亏呢？"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 113,
        "time_range": "00:05:44,310 --> 00:05:46,220",
        "quote": "我只知道是吧，条件一。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 114,
        "time_range": "00:05:46,220 --> 00:05:49,610",
        "quote": "日美之间为了维持这个汇率的升值。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 115,
        "time_range": "00:05:49,610 --> 00:05:53,000",
        "quote": "日本这边真真金白银砸了900多亿美元进去。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 116,
        "time_range": "00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:58,530",
        "quote": "然后条件2啊，贝森特说，在这个操作过程中，他盈利了啊，他花了10亿美元。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 117,
        "time_range": "00:05:58,530 --> 00:06:00,140",
        "quote": "他盈利的几千万美元。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 118,
        "time_range": "00:06:00,140 --> 00:06:01,740",
        "quote": "啊，这个盈利的比例。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 119,
        "time_range": "00:06:01,740 --> 00:06:03,000",
        "quote": "是相当之高的。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 120,
        "time_range": "00:06:03,110 --> 00:06:06,670",
        "quote": "那用膝盖想都知道吗？这个钱是谁出的？那日本人出的嘛。"
      }
    ],
    "initial_disposition": "deferred",
    "numeric_policy": "All literal numbers, units, modal and negation tokens remain in unmodified quotes; no inferred conversion.",
    "assertion_time": "UNKNOWN",
    "referenced_time": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_EXPLICIT_IN_QUOTES",
    "external_truth": "NOT_VERIFIED"
  },
  {
    "claim_id": "EP003/C07",
    "normalized_statement": "博主从成本和收益分布解释汇率干预双方的不同动机。",
    "quotes": [
      {
        "cue_id": 121,
        "time_range": "00:06:06,670 --> 00:06:10,580",
        "quote": "那贝森特在这种时候跳脸告诉你，日本花钱。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 122,
        "time_range": "00:06:10,580 --> 00:06:15,190",
        "quote": "跟美国配合买美国高抬贵手，美国在这里面一举两吃。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 123,
        "time_range": "00:06:15,230 --> 00:06:17,540",
        "quote": "真正的目的在告告诉你啥呢？"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 124,
        "time_range": "00:06:17,540 --> 00:06:21,130",
        "quote": "告诉你，当我完全的控制了日元汇率以后。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 125,
        "time_range": "00:06:21,130 --> 00:06:22,740",
        "quote": "那后边的这个单。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 126,
        "time_range": "00:06:22,740 --> 00:06:24,970",
        "quote": "是由日本人买，而不是美国人买。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 127,
        "time_range": "00:06:24,970 --> 00:06:27,180",
        "quote": "那么这个清晰的很，这逻辑清晰的很。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 128,
        "time_range": "00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:33,410",
        "quote": "信息给你传递的毫无呃没有任何的这个障碍，也没有任何的误解空间，非常的清晰。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 129,
        "time_range": "00:06:33,450 --> 00:06:34,100",
        "quote": "啊。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 130,
        "time_range": "00:06:34,100 --> 00:06:36,010",
        "quote": "那日美关系摆成这样子。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 131,
        "time_range": "00:06:36,010 --> 00:06:38,820",
        "quote": "还有现在还有各种的分析告诉你。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 132,
        "time_range": "00:06:38,820 --> 00:06:42,300",
        "quote": "日本和美国之间的金融关系嵌套在一起。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 133,
        "time_range": "00:06:42,300 --> 00:06:44,920",
        "quote": "而不是互相之间算计是对方。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 134,
        "time_range": "00:06:44,940 --> 00:06:46,860",
        "quote": "那就是睁着眼睛说瞎话吧。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 135,
        "time_range": "00:06:46,890 --> 00:06:49,030",
        "quote": "那按照这样的思路来看的话。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 136,
        "time_range": "00:06:49,030 --> 00:06:52,300",
        "quote": "那美国现在这个时间节点上，美联储加息。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 137,
        "time_range": "00:06:52,300 --> 00:06:57,190",
        "quote": "那简直就是图穷匕现最后那一下嘛，匕首都露出来了。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 138,
        "time_range": "00:06:57,290 --> 00:06:59,220",
        "quote": "意思是非常非常明显的。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 139,
        "time_range": "00:06:59,310 --> 00:07:03,070",
        "quote": "那为啥这个时间节点上把这个匕首露出来了？一方面是。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 140,
        "time_range": "00:07:03,070 --> 00:07:05,600",
        "quote": "不愿意等了，一方面是等不住了。"
      }
    ],
    "initial_disposition": "active",
