  {
    "claim_id": "EP003/C11",
    "normalized_statement": "博主认为需求替代会限制能源涨价向更高价格持续推进。",
    "quotes": [
      {
        "cue_id": 198,
        "time_range": "00:09:58,530 --> 00:10:02,270",
        "quote": "中国这边确确实实需求并没有随着。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 199,
        "time_range": "00:10:02,270 --> 00:10:06,230",
        "quote": "啊，你这边的供应减少了，那我就顺手推舟，我就少买一点，为啥呢？"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 200,
        "time_range": "00:10:06,230 --> 00:10:08,310",
        "quote": "因为供应减少了价格上升了。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 201,
        "time_range": "00:10:08,310 --> 00:10:11,300",
        "quote": "那这么贵的油我没必要，但是在干嘛呢？"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 202,
        "time_range": "00:10:11,300 --> 00:10:14,400",
        "quote": "中国通过实际的宏观调控能力告诉你。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 203,
        "time_range": "00:10:14,410 --> 00:10:17,560",
        "quote": "中国自己国内发生的新能源革命。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 204,
        "time_range": "00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:18,780",
        "quote": "新能源车替代。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 205,
        "time_range": "00:10:18,780 --> 00:10:19,590",
        "quote": "燃油车。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 206,
        "time_range": "00:10:19,590 --> 00:10:24,920",
        "quote": "他就是可以释放出来这么多的额外的石油的需求出来，没有必要去买了。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 207,
        "time_range": "00:10:24,950 --> 00:10:28,170",
        "quote": "这个是个长期存在的事儿。很多小伙伴说。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 208,
        "time_range": "00:10:28,170 --> 00:10:31,860",
        "quote": "那新能源对于这个石油市场的这个影响，还是预期。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 209,
        "time_range": "00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:34,300",
        "quote": "还在未来，不是在未来，就在眼下。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 210,
        "time_range": "00:10:34,570 --> 00:10:36,460",
        "quote": "因为这个直接就通过。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 211,
        "time_range": "00:10:36,460 --> 00:10:41,710",
        "quote": "从3月份到9月份的市场的交易告诉你了，清清楚楚，明明白白的告诉你了。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 212,
        "time_range": "00:10:41,710 --> 00:10:42,840",
        "quote": "啊，这是一个。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 213,
        "time_range": "00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:46,220",
        "quote": "压制油价的一个最重要的原因之一啊。"
      }
    ],
    "initial_disposition": "active",
    "numeric_policy": "All literal numbers, units, modal and negation tokens remain in unmodified quotes; no inferred conversion.",
    "assertion_time": "UNKNOWN",
    "referenced_time": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_EXPLICIT_IN_QUOTES",
    "external_truth": "NOT_VERIFIED"
  },
  {
    "claim_id": "EP003/C12",
    "normalized_statement": "能源冲击传导时长出现月份、半年与“8年”等不一致表述，需核听。",
    "quotes": [
      {
        "cue_id": 238,
        "time_range": "00:11:53,370 --> 00:11:58,140",
        "quote": "很多很多通胀的因素在整个经济体体系里边传导。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 239,
        "time_range": "00:11:58,140 --> 00:12:03,490",
        "quote": "大概的运转周期是6个月到9个月，长的话要一年时间。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 240,
        "time_range": "00:12:03,490 --> 00:12:05,560",
        "quote": "最短最短也要8年时间。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 241,
        "time_range": "00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:06,290",
        "quote": "是吧。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 242,
        "time_range": "00:12:06,290 --> 00:12:07,940",
        "quote": "Thesre and theventti."
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 243,
        "time_range": "00:12:07,940 --> 00:12:11,670",
        "quote": "到9月份爆发出来，那现在在买单呢？"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 244,
        "time_range": "00:12:11,760 --> 00:12:16,280",
        "quote": "是霍尔木斯海峡刚刚封锁的时候引起的大波动。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 245,
        "time_range": "00:12:16,510 --> 00:12:19,410",
        "quote": "那这个大波动后续的这个走势，你看的很清楚吧。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 246,
        "time_range": "00:12:19,410 --> 00:12:23,110",
        "quote": "3月份的时候，这个油价很高是吧？100左右110左右。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 247,
        "time_range": "00:12:23,110 --> 00:12:27,250",
        "quote": "后边的话落回来了，落回到80左右了，那现在又涨了100左右了。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 248,
        "time_range": "00:12:27,250 --> 00:12:31,330",
        "quote": "那后边这个通胀的预期在这样的传导之下的话。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 249,
        "time_range": "00:12:31,330 --> 00:12:32,140",
        "quote": "一方面。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 250,
        "time_range": "00:12:32,140 --> 00:12:35,010",
        "quote": "他们互相之间信号的波动会被拉平，对吧？"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 251,
        "time_range": "00:12:35,010 --> 00:12:36,010",
        "quote": "另一方面呢。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 252,
        "time_range": "00:12:36,010 --> 00:12:41,120",
        "quote": "这个持续强的输入会一直让这个信号的强度维持一个比较高的水平。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 253,
        "time_range": "00:12:41,180 --> 00:12:42,250",
        "quote": "也就是啥呢？"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 254,
        "time_range": "00:12:42,250 --> 00:12:46,700",
        "quote": "这通胀不会随着你美联储的表态，不会随着你美联储的加息。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 255,
        "time_range": "00:12:46,700 --> 00:12:50,180",
        "quote": "有任何的改变，不会改变的，就算是要改变。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 256,
        "time_range": "00:12:50,180 --> 00:12:52,170",
        "quote": "那也是6个月以后的事了。"
      }
    ],
    "initial_disposition": "deferred",
    "numeric_policy": "All literal numbers, units, modal and negation tokens remain in unmodified quotes; no inferred conversion.",
    "assertion_time": "UNKNOWN",
    "referenced_time": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_EXPLICIT_IN_QUOTES",
    "external_truth": "NOT_VERIFIED"
  },
  {
    "claim_id": "EP003/C13",
    "normalized_statement": "博主判断到明年3月前难以降息，可能继续加息；时间依据尚待核对。",
    "quotes": [
      {
        "cue_id": 257,
        "time_range": "00:12:52,210 --> 00:12:54,890",
        "quote": "但是呢卧室这次讲话讲的很清楚。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 258,
        "time_range": "00:12:54,910 --> 00:12:59,600",
        "quote": "高昂的通胀，持续超长时间的通胀，是我们无法忍受的。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 259,
        "time_range": "00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:03,390",
        "quote": "他既然通过加息向着通胀这个目标发起了冲锋。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 260,
        "time_range": "00:13:03,390 --> 00:13:04,820",
        "quote": "那就意味着。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 261,
        "time_range": "00:13:04,820 --> 00:13:07,780",
        "quote": "不管这个结果如何，这个过程它肯定是不会变的。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 262,
        "time_range": "00:13:07,860 --> 00:13:08,810",
        "quote": "所以呢。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 263,
        "time_range": "00:13:08,810 --> 00:13:11,600",
        "quote": "所以在明年的3月份之前。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 264,
        "time_range": "00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:14,510",
        "quote": "你可以大胆的有一个具具体的概念。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 265,
        "time_range": "00:13:14,510 --> 00:13:17,300",
        "quote": "美联储是绝对不会降息的。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 266,
        "time_range": "00:13:17,370 --> 00:13:20,240",
        "quote": "甚至呢他有可能都不会停止加息。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 267,
        "time_range": "00:13:20,300 --> 00:13:23,300",
        "quote": "区别只是加息的幅度可能会变化。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 268,
        "time_range": "00:13:23,300 --> 00:13:24,990",
        "quote": "加息的节奏会有变化。"
      }
    ],
    "initial_disposition": "active",
    "numeric_policy": "All literal numbers, units, modal and negation tokens remain in unmodified quotes; no inferred conversion.",
    "assertion_time": "UNKNOWN",
    "referenced_time": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_EXPLICIT_IN_QUOTES",
    "external_truth": "NOT_VERIFIED"
  },
  {
    "claim_id": "EP003/C14",
    "normalized_statement": "博主认为AI题材依赖流动性，持续紧缩会使其承压。",
    "quotes": [
      {
        "cue_id": 270,
        "time_range": "00:13:26,070 --> 00:13:30,090",
        "quote": "对很多很多长期对流动性有依赖。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 271,
        "time_range": "00:13:30,090 --> 00:13:33,800",
        "quote": "对于长期的流动性支撑很敏感的题材。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 272,
        "time_range": "00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:35,520",
        "quote": "是致命的打击。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 273,
        "time_range": "00:13:35,550 --> 00:13:36,540",
        "quote": "所以呢。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 274,
        "time_range": "00:13:36,540 --> 00:13:38,580",
        "quote": "啊，第二个结论就显而易见了。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 275,
        "time_range": "00:13:38,580 --> 00:13:42,830",
        "quote": "这次的加息是敲响了AI泡沫破裂的三钟。"
      }
    ],
    "initial_disposition": "active",
    "numeric_policy": "All literal numbers, units, modal and negation tokens remain in unmodified quotes; no inferred conversion.",
    "assertion_time": "UNKNOWN",
    "referenced_time": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_EXPLICIT_IN_QUOTES",
    "external_truth": "NOT_VERIFIED"
  },
  {
    "claim_id": "EP003/C15",
    "normalized_statement": "博主用受伤苹果比喻旧题材，在再次冲击下可能先受损。",
    "quotes": [
      {
        "cue_id": 297,
        "time_range": "00:14:54,970 --> 00:14:56,840",
        "quote": "5月份的时候，这个泡沫。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 298,
        "time_range": "00:14:56,840 --> 00:15:00,990",
        "quote": "已经出现了明显的裂纹，当时的时候已经引发了动荡。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 299,
        "time_range": "00:15:00,990 --> 00:15:03,590",
        "quote": "我当时就告诉你了嘛，这是一个坏题材。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 300,
        "time_range": "00:15:03,610 --> 00:15:04,650",
        "quote": "一个。"
      },
      {
        "cue_id": 301,
        "time_range": "00:15:04,650 --> 00:15:06,690",
